        "heading_raw": "Prerequisites",
        "body_raw": "Spell Mastery, wizard level 1st."
      },
      {
        "heading_raw": "Benefit",
        "body_raw": "When you prepare your spells each day, you can choose to keep a number of spell slots equal to your Intelligence modifier (minimum 1) flexibly prepared. Instead of preparing a single spell within each of these slots, you can partially prepare two spells. Anytime after you prepare these flexible slots, you can spend a full-round action to finalize one slot, choosing one of the two spells to be finished and fully prepared in that slot."
      }
